{"product_id":"heets-purple-label","title":"IQOS HEETS Purple Wave","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"short-description\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003ePurple Wave Selection Label IQOS HEETS Purple Wave (previously known as Purple Label) flavor has strong tobacco flavour with a taste almost heavy as cigars. For use only with IQOS devices. Buy IQOS Purple Heets Kenya at your doorstep.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"short-description\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"short-description\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis carton contains 10 packs of HEETS tobacco sticks. Each pack contains 20 sticks, for a total of 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS HEETS are real tobacco sticks made for IQOS 'Heat Not Burn' products.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41673629958199,"sku":"Heets Purple Wave - Pack","price":590.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41673629990967,"sku":"Heets Purple Wave - Carton","price":5000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/heets-purple.png?v=1747872157","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/heets-purple-label","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




